#subtitle: Building relations with the other political parties of Germany.

= Inter-Party Relationships

The <span style="color: #E57373;">RNU</span> has only gone so far because of our <span style="color: #E53935;">al</span><span style="color: #2E7D32;">li</span><span style="color: #DAB74C;">es</span>. Though beyond them, we could also try and reach out to the <span style="color: ##591716;">le</span><span style="color: #2B0303;">ft</span> and to the non oligarchic <span style="color: '#303F9F;">rig</span> <span style="color: '#F57C00;">ht</span>. 

- @allies: Strengthen our bonds with the parties in the <span style="color: #E53935;">Fat</span><span style="color: #E57373;">her</span><span style="color: #2E7D32;">lan</span><span style="color: #DAB74C;">d</span> <span style="color: #E53935;">F</span><span style="color: #E57373;">ro</span><span style="color: #2E7D32;">n</span><span style="color: #DAB74C;">t</span>.
- @right: Strengthen our bond with the <span style="color: #303F9F;">National Conservatives</span> and the <span style="color: #F57C00;">Liberal Constitutionalists</span> parties on the right.
- @liberals: Strengthen our bonds with the <span style="color: #DAB74C;">Lib</span><span style="color: #F57C00;">erals</span>. 
- @left: Look towards reconciliation with the <span style="color: #591716;">communists</span> but also the broader <span style="color: #591716;">le</span><span style="color: #591716;">ft</span>
- @bf: Lets increase ties with the <span style="color: #2E7D32;">Peasant Front</span>.
- @su: How about looking to improving our standing with the <span style="color: #E53935;">Socialist Union</span>?
- @lonely: Maybe not now.
- @easy_discard

@allies
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; su_relation += 10*(1-dissent); bf_relation +=10*(1-dissent); rlrp_relation +=10*(1-dissent); front_unity += 10;

We have improved our relations with the <span style="color: #E53935;">F</span><span style="color: #E57373;">ro</span><span style="color: #2E7D32;">n</span><span style="color: #DAB74C;">t</span>.


@right
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rnkp_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); lcpr_relation += 5*(1 - dissent); left_dissent += 4;

The <span style="color: '#303F9F;">rig</span> <span style="color: '#F57C00;">ht</span> has a history of neutrality or outright cooperation with the oligarchs, though this not mean we cannot ally them. Our left faction expresses displeasure, but the <span style="color: '#303F9F;">rig</span> <span style="color: '#F57C00;">ht</span> might be a needed ally against the oligarchs.




@liberals
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rlrp_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); lcpr_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); left_dissent += 2;

The <span style="color: #DAB74C;">Lib</span><span style="color: #F57C00;">erals</span> are receptive to our efforts, especially the <span style="color: #DAB74C;">RLRP</span>. The left faction of our party is annoyed that we are negotiating with the <span style="color: #F57C00;">Liberal Constitutionalists</span>.


@left
subtitle: -1 resources The <span style="color: #E53935;">SU</span> will certainly be pleased.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; rkp_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); su_relation += 6*(1 - dissent); reformist_dissent += 2; lcpr_relation -= 2; rnkp_relation -=2; left_dissent -= 5;

The <span style="color: #591716;">RKP</span> used to be a member of the <span style="color: #E53935;">F</span><span style="color: #E57373;">ro</span><span style="color: #2E7D32;">n</span><span style="color: #DAB74C;">t</span> and have generally been friendly, albeit wary, towards us. The <span style="color: #E53935;">SU</span> and our left faction are also pleased with us, since this could lead to future reconcilliation and cooperation.

@bf
subtitle: -1 resources 
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; bf_relation += 10*(1 - dissent); 

The <span style="color: #2E7D32;">Peasant Front</span> is one of our closest allies, so increasing our relations comes naturally.

@su
subtitle: -1 resources 
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; su_relation += 10*(1 - dissent); 

Despite being a splinter party of both <span style="color: #E57373;">us</span> and the <span style="color: #591716;">RKP</span>, the <span style="color: #E53935;">SU</span> is one of our closest allies, but they would've preffered us focusing on the broader <span style="color: #591716;">le</span><span style="color: #2B0303;">ft</span> rather than just them.


@lonely

Whether it is because we *cannot* or *will not*, we do not make ties with other parties at this moment.

- @return: Continue...
